                </div>
                <h3>Stop stitching together 5 tools for one employee lifecycle</h3>
                <p>Recruitment, onboarding, payroll, attendance, PMS, expense claims, exit, alumni � all under a single login. One employee record, zero duplicate data entry.</p>
            </div>

