                    <i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen-button"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>Your HR team shouldn't be answering "where's my payslip?" 200 times a month</h3>
                <p>Payslips, leave balances, claims, Form 16, tax declarations � employees access everything from the HR app. HR gets hours back, every single week.</p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Buttons -->
        <div class="image-features-buttons">
            <a href="#" class="img-btn-purple">Explore HRMS</a>
            <a href="#" class="img-btn-purple">Explore Payroll</a>
        </div>

    </section>

    <section class="ecosystem-section">

        <div class="ecosystem-header">
            <h2>More than software. An <span>ecosystem</span> that grows with your HR team.</h2>
            <p>Free courses, a nationwide HR community, compliance wikis, and expert webinars � all included with every plan. No premium tier required.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ecosystem-grid">

            <!-- Box 1: HR Academy (Yellow Tint) -->
            <div class="eco-card eco-yellow">
                <div class="eco-img-box">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code eco-icon"></i>
                </div>
                <h3>HR Academy</h3>
                <p>Free certification courses on payroll, compliance, and HR operations</p>
                <a href="#" class="know-more">Know More</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Box 2: HR Community (Mint Tint) -->
